SDV aebs:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:5ms+/-0ms, DL: 1ms+/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP:5ms+/-0ms, DL: 1ms+/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP:5ms+/-0ms, DL: 1ms+/-0ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 5ms+/-0ms, AD: 1ms+/-0ms)    
    Actuator Signal Alarm (triggered on event, AD: 1ms+/-0ms)
App :
    Component Fusion :
        Signal Fusion_data
        Service S3:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera
            subscribe to VSS signal Lidar
            subscribe to VSS signal Radar
            publish Fusion_data
            periodic 5ms+/-0ms
            execution 1ms+/-0ms
    Component AEB_controler :
        Service S2:
            subscribe to Fusion_data
            publish to VSS signal Alarm
            publish to VSS signal Brake
            triggered on Fusion_data
            execution 1ms+/-0ms

Functional Chains:
    chain : Camera -> S3 -> S2 -> Brake